# cargo's own build output directory.
target

# the "target" pattern above matches any path component named "target"
# anywhere in the tree, including vendor/cc/src/target/ (the cc crate's own
# source subdirectory, unrelated to cargo's build dir). re-include vendor/
# wholesale so no ignore rule - this one or any other, e.g. the repo root
# .gitignore's *.bin - can hide files cargo vendor committed here; cargo
# verifies each vendored file's checksum, so a missing file breaks the build.
!vendor
!vendor/**
